        q: 'How much does a Shopify wholesale portal cost?',
        a: `<p>I quote a fixed price per project, plus a block of hours for maintenance afterwards. The fixed price comes out of the list of rules that have to be built, so writing that list is the first thing we do.</p>
<p>For a sense of scale: the most complex portal I have worked on has taken over a hundred hours of front-end work alone, and I was one of several people, with a separate backend team. One with company access, catalogs and a simple variant table sits in a completely different bracket.</p>
<p>What moves the number most is the plan, and not because of Shopify's fee: without Plus you are capped at three active catalogs, so your whole price structure has to fit inside them. With Plus you can have dozens of catalogs and cross them with Markets, and that changes the entire project, not just the invoice.</p>
<p>The four factors that decide a quote, and how to compare two that look nothing alike, are in <a href="${docPath('questions', 'how-much-does-a-shopify-b2b-portal-cost', 'en')}">how much a Shopify B2B portal costs</a>.</p>`,
